        "node_id": "n_1_15dc9d",
        "thought_text": "Sort the planets based on their x-coordinates, y-coordinates, and z-coordinates separately. Connect adjacent planets in the sorted lists using the minimum of the differences in their x, y, and z coordinates. This approach ensures that we are considering the smallest possible tunnel costs first.",
