        "node_id": "n_2_70b592",
        "thought_text": "Use a minimum spanning tree (MST) algorithm, such as Kruskal's or Prim's, to find the least cost way to connect all planets. The edge weights for the MST would be the tunnel costs calculated using the given formula. This method guarantees an optimal solution.",
